plid get_grenade_pid(integer index) ->
Returns the pid of the player who threw the grenade with the given <var>index</var>.
Indexes that do not refer to an existant grenade invoke undefined behavior.

teamid get_grenade_team(integer index) ->
Returns the team the player who threw the grenade had at the time of throwing.
Invalid indexes invoke undefined behavior.

fvec3 get_grenade_position(integer index) ->
Returns the grenade's position.
Invalid indexes invoke undefined behavior.

fvec3 get_grenade_velocity(integer index) ->
Returns the grenade's velocity vector.
Invalid indexes invoke undefined behavior.

number get_grenade_detonate_time(integer index) ->
Returns the time (as determined by get_time()) the grenade will detonate.
The grenade is only checked for detonation every tick(). <!-- TODO: does it have to, though? what does pyshits do? -->

